# Experimental / not wired in.
#
# The files in this directory are alternate implementations of solver
# components (smoothers, coarse operators, cycle drivers, aggregation
# schemes) that have been drafted for evaluation but are not part of
# the built binary. They are intentionally kept out of `Makefile` and
# out of the include search path used by `src/main.c` so that the
# shipped binary is unambiguous.
#
# These files are documentation / staging only. They compile in
# isolation but are not linked into `elliptic_mg`. Do not assume that
# any behavior implemented here is exercised at runtime.
